				{
					"id": 105010301,
					"content": "不用为我费工夫，我一点都不馋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010302,
					"content": "虽然还是有点饿，但…也没什么大不了的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1050104,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1050107
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1050107",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1050107,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"莫娜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 105010401,
					"content": "终于到蒙德了，唉，好累啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010402,
					"content": "想得到伟大而深奥的知识，果然不容易…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010403,
					"content": "我倒是没那么累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010404,
					"content": "因为你是飘在天上的啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010405,
					"content": "唉，看来占星术士也没那么厉害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010406,
					"content": "那是因为你对占星术有太多不切实际的幻想了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010407,
					"content": "你们几位，也是在这里歇脚么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010408,
					"content": "请问你是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010409,
					"content": "哦，我们几兄弟都是商人，刚在璃月港做完生意，准备回蒙德。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010410,
					"content": "看你们好像挺累的样子，我们订的马车一会儿就来了，要不要一起走？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010411,
						105010413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010411,
					"content": "我也有点累了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010412
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105010413,
					"content": "要收钱吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105010412,
					"content": "哈哈，那就一起走吧，路上多几个伴聊聊天。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010414,
					"content": "不用啦不用啦，反正是顺路的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010415,
					"content": "没这个需要，快闪开快闪开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010416,
					"content": "欸？这位小姐…有什么不方便吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010417,
					"content": "别装模作样了，强盗先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010418,
					"content": "挑路上看起来好欺负的人下手，只要对方上了车，就会把车拉到荒郊野岭，洗劫一通，对吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010419,
					"content": "你、你在说什么？！咱们好心来搭话，却被当驴肝肺，还血口喷人！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010420,
					"content": "不坐车就不坐，神经病。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010421,
					"content": "那，要不要我现在说说你们身上，有哪些东西是抢来的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010422,
					"content": "不服气的话，我说完之后，找人来对质一番，就什么都明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010423,
					"content": "如果我输了，我愿意赔你两万摩拉。如果我赢了，那你们就得去璃月港吃牢饭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010424,
					"content": "怎么样，要真是正经做生意的人，没什么不敢的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010425,
					"content": "你、你…！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010426,
					"content": "你真是把我惹毛了！小丫头！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010427,
					"content": "我不知道你是怎么知道的，但只要灭了你的口，就不会有人知道了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010427,
						105010428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泰勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010428,
					"content": "莫娜，小心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010430
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105010429,
					"content": "不会让你们伤害她。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010430
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105010430,
					"content": "别在意，几个强盗而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105010431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105010431,
					"content": "之前你们说占星术士「没那么厉害」…那正好给你们看看，师父威风的一面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				}
			]
		},
