					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011214,
					"content": "占星术士要专注于研究星空，若是被世间凡庸之物扰了心神，就会影响判断。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011215,
					"content": "尤其是用摩拉去过度满足生理欲望，是低俗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011216,
					"content": "咕咕咕——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011217,
					"content": "…又危险的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011218,
					"content": "所以不吃我们点的菜，这也是占星术士的尊严吗？真的好难懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011219,
					"content": "但只有我们大吃大喝了一顿，会不会不太好？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011220,
					"content": "我来露一手吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105011221,
					"content": "哦，对啊，还可以这样！你等我们一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
