					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011511
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 105011511,
					"content": "璃月佳肴的美味，不是说说而已啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011512,
					"content": "这么一想，花了这么多摩拉也不是那么心痛了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011513,
					"content": "啊，没什么，没什么。吃饱喝足，我们该出发了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						105011514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 105011514,
					"content": "从这里继续往北，就能抵达<color=#00E1FFFF>石门</color>，然后就进入蒙德境内了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
